{"id":"f2048e5139e9d29b","group":"67","path":"67/67-lem-orey-hajek.md","title":"Finite Consistency Characterization","display":"lem-orey-hajek — Finite Consistency Characterization","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom","book_abbrev":"67","label":"67-lem-orey-hajek","aliases":["67-lem-orey-hajek"],"display":"lem-orey-hajek — Finite Consistency Characterization","depends_on":["[[67-df-interpretability]]","[[67-df-finite-subtheory]]","[[67-df-reflexive-theory]]","[[67-df-PA]]","[[67-thm-arithmetized-completeness]]","[[67-df-formula-provability]]","[[67-df-strong-godel-encoding]]","[[67-df-certified-proof]]","[[67-df-proof-representation]]"],"source_scope":"第 6 章 §1，Lemma 2 及 Lemma 3，印刷页 80；PDF 第 91 页","verification_status":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified","source_proof_status":"本次检查定义接口、依赖与陈述形式；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"inherited_verification_status":"source-statement-checked","inherited_source_proof_status":"已读 Lemma 2 证明与 Lemma 3 陈述；依赖 Theorem 4 的原书草图，未补齐完整算术化证明","machine_verified":false,"revision_date":"2026-10-14"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"67"},{"key":"label","html":"67-lem-orey-hajek"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67-lem-orey-hajek</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-orey-hajek — Finite Consistency Characterization"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"44cd21d3d12e4d8d\" href=\"?note=44cd21d3d12e4d8d\" title=\"67-df-interpretability\">67-df-interpretability</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"650dc4b8018183d7\" href=\"?note=650dc4b8018183d7\" title=\"67-df-finite-subtheory\">67-df-finite-subtheory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5c333dbc176d20e8\" href=\"?note=5c333dbc176d20e8\" title=\"67-df-reflexive-theory\">67-df-reflexive-theory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"cd051851df5d2aa2\" href=\"?note=cd051851df5d2aa2\" title=\"67-df-PA\">67-df-PA</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"422d9b41ae960a38\" href=\"?note=422d9b41ae960a38\" title=\"67-thm-arithmetized-completeness\">67-thm-arithmetized-completeness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"1e05755479add015\" href=\"?note=1e05755479add015\" title=\"67-df-formula-provability\">67-df-formula-provability</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"a329235da6144513\" href=\"?note=a329235da6144513\" title=\"67-df-strong-godel-encoding\">67-df-strong-godel-encoding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"189f5355af0e487c\" href=\"?note=189f5355af0e487c\" title=\"67-df-certified-proof\">67-df-certified-proof</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"3fa0d0f598b791bc\" href=\"?note=3fa0d0f598b791bc\" title=\"67-df-proof-representation\">67-df-proof-representation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"第 6 章 §1，Lemma 2 及 Lemma 3，印刷页 80；PDF 第 91 页"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"本次检查定义接口、依赖与陈述形式；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"inherited_verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"inherited_source_proof_status","html":"已读 Lemma 2 证明与 Lemma 3 陈述；依赖 Theorem 4 的原书草图，未补齐完整算术化证明"},{"key":"machine_verified","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-14"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\">\\(S,T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\)</span> 是一致公理集，其标准代码集为原始递归集；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\\subseteq T\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\subseteq T\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 不必扩张 PA。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\unlhd\">\\(\\unlhd\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"44cd21d3d12e4d8d\" href=\"?note=44cd21d3d12e4d8d\" title=\"67-df-interpretability\">67-df-interpretability</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\upharpoonright k\">\\(S\\upharpoonright k\\)</span> 与其内部一致性句取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"650dc4b8018183d7\" href=\"?note=650dc4b8018183d7\" title=\"67-df-finite-subtheory\">67-df-finite-subtheory</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>编码、有限公理集的一致性表示和理论呈现固定为本册固定算术化；所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 的量词是外部自然数量词。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>本条的固定编号为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"a329235da6144513\" href=\"?note=a329235da6144513\" title=\"67-df-strong-godel-encoding\">67-df-strong-godel-encoding</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g=c_{L_A}\">\\(g=c_{L_A}\\)</span>。每个出现的有效理论 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 绑定 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"189f5355af0e487c\" href=\"?note=189f5355af0e487c\" title=\"67-df-certified-proof\">67-df-certified-proof</a> 的呈示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_A\">\\(E_A\\)</span>；使用内部证明公式时固定同一 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GRep}(D,\\gamma)\">\\(\\mathrm{GRep}(D,\\gamma)\\)</span> 及 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"3fa0d0f598b791bc\" href=\"?note=3fa0d0f598b791bc\" title=\"67-df-proof-representation\">67-df-proof-representation</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StdPrf}_{A,E_A}(\\mathrm{Prf}_A,e_{\\mathrm{prf},A})\">\\(\\mathrm{StdPrf}_{A,E_A}(\\mathrm{Prf}_A,e_{\\mathrm{prf},A})\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"S\\unlhd T\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\ (T\\vdash\\mathrm{Con}_{S\\upharpoonright k}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[S\\unlhd T\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\ (T\\vdash\\mathrm{Con}_{S\\upharpoonright k}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本节保留的原书页码、既往核对记录及证明说明来自输入档案；本次未提供原书 PDF，以下既往记录不表示本次重新完成了来源或证明核验。</p>\n<p>来源陈述已逐项核对，并查看 PDF 第 91 页图像确认 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\upharpoonright k\">\\(S\\upharpoonright k\\)</span> 和外部“每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span>”。这里没有把右侧改为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\vdash\\forall k\\,\\mathrm{Con}_{S\\upharpoonright k}\">\\(T\\vdash\\forall k\\,\\mathrm{Con}_{S\\upharpoonright k}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>来源证明两方向已读：解释的每个有限源片段落入有限目标片段，有限一致性转移再用 PA 扩张的反身性。反向取 PR 双表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span>，构造 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma^*(x)=\\sigma(x)\\land\\mathrm{Con}_{\\sigma\\upharpoonright x}\">\\(\\sigma^*(x)=\\sigma(x)\\land\\mathrm{Con}_{\\sigma\\upharpoonright x}\\)</span>；Lemma 3 保证它仍双表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 且 PA 证明其一致性，随后用算术化完备性 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"422d9b41ae960a38\" href=\"?note=422d9b41ae960a38\" title=\"67-thm-arithmetized-completeness\">67-thm-arithmetized-completeness</a> 得解释。任意公式表示下的内部一致性及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\upharpoonright x\">\\(\\sigma\\upharpoonright x\\)</span> 现在显式引用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-16\" data-note=\"1e05755479add015\" href=\"?note=1e05755479add015\" title=\"67-df-formula-provability\">67-df-formula-provability</a>，截断采用原书 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\\le x\">\\(z\\le x\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>Theorem 4 原书仅提供较详细草图（印刷页 77–80）；本次核对该草图与引用链，不把它登记为已补齐全部形式证明。</p>\n<p>来源：Per Lindström, <em>Aspects of Incompleteness</em>，原档案所引 PDF；第 6 章 §1，Lemma 2 及 Lemma 3，印刷页 80；PDF 第 91 页。</p>\n<p>证明核验范围：已读 Lemma 2 证明与 Lemma 3 陈述；依赖 Theorem 4 的原书草图，未补齐完整算术化证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-interpretability","status":"resolved","id":"44cd21d3d12e4d8d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-interpretability]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-finite-subtheory","status":"resolved","id":"650dc4b8018183d7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-finite-subtheory]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-reflexive-theory","status":"resolved","id":"5c333dbc176d20e8","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-reflexive-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-PA","status":"resolved","id":"cd051851df5d2aa2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-PA]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-thm-arithmetized-completeness","status":"resolved","id":"422d9b41ae960a38","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-thm-arithmetized-completeness]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-formula-provability","status":"resolved","id":"1e05755479add015","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-formula-provability]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-strong-godel-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"a329235da6144513","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-strong-godel-encoding]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-certified-proof","status":"resolved","id":"189f5355af0e487c","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-certified-proof]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-proof-representation","status":"resolved","id":"3fa0d0f598b791bc","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_o